        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="974102999" x="864" y="288" w="342" h="216" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454143" />
            <param name="arrows" value="16" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[~~~~ HELP? ~~~~

Navigate to the PSCADView library in the workspace for helpful explainations on usage of this block.

When testing a generating plant PSCAD case, copy the library file and test data .txt files to the PSCAD case, open the library file, then paste the PMView block into the generating plant case.  It is much better to use the library rather than copy-transfer the PMView block from this example page here.]]></Sticky>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="1930098385" x="918" y="0" w="288" h="270" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="8454016" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[TEST PROFILES:
____________________
1.  Flatstart
2.  LVRT (data file has ERCOT Legacy)
3.  HVRT (data file has ERCOT Legacy)
4.  V-down
5.  V-up
6.  LVRT Dips (ieee2800 / nogrr245 Preferred)
7.  HVRT Preferred (ieee2800)
8.  Angle down
9.  Angle up
10.  Custom fault(s)
11.  Frequency Down
12.  Frequency Up
13.  V up and down w/ impedance
14.  Short Ckt Ratio SCR
15.  PMU playback]]></Sticky>
        <Sticky classid="Sticky" id="1707612167" x="90" y="18" w="594" h="108" colors="0, 15792890">
          <paramlist>
            <param name="full_font" value="Tahoma, 9pt" />
            <param name="align" value="0" />
            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="16777152" />
            <param name="arrows" value="0" />
            <param name="opacity" value="25" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[====== SIMPLE TEST CASE ========

This simple case tests a resistor that we pretend represents a black-boxed IBR plant we wish to examine.

Although a voltage plot is provided below, the PMView box has much more useful plots inside including Ppoi, Qpoi, instantaneous voltage and current.]]></Sticky>
        <User classid="UserCmp" name="master:consti" id="856816176" x="792" y="36" w="69" h="19" z="10" orient="0" defn="master:consti" link="-1" q="4">
          <paramlist link="-1" name="" crc="89924856">
            <param name="Name" value="" />
            <param name="Value" value="15" />
          </paramlist>
        </User>
      </schematic>
